      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Assemble the quotient rule: \\( f'(x) = 3^{- 2 x} \\left(- 3^{x} \\left(\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 1\\right)^{3} \\ln{\\left(3 \\right)} + 6 \\cdot 3^{x} \\left(\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 1\\right)^{2} \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right) \\).",
